    {
      "source": "Whether the given <a href=\"../../../../../core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core\">method parameter</a> is\nsupported by this resolver.",
      "translation": "给定<a href=\"../../../../../core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core\">方法参数</a>是否由该解析器支持。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolves a method parameter into an argument value from a given request.\nA <a href=\"../../../../method/support/ModelAndViewContainer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>ModelAndViewContainer</code></a> provides access to the model for the\nrequest. A <a href=\"../../../../bind/support/WebDataBinderFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.bind.support\"><code>WebDataBinderFactory</code></a> provides a way to create\na <a href=\"../../../../bind/WebDataBinder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.bind\"><code>WebDataBinder</code></a> instance when needed for data binding and\ntype conversion purposes.",
      "translation": "将方法参数解析为来自给定请求的参数值。<a href=\"../../../../method/support/ModelAndViewContainer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>ModelAndViewContainer</code></a> 提供对请求模型的访问。当需要用于数据绑定和类型转换时，<a href=\"../../../../bind/support/WebDataBinderFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.bind.support\"><code>WebDataBinderFactory</code></a> 提供了一种创建 <a href=\"../../../../bind/WebDataBinder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.bind\"><code>WebDataBinder</code></a> 实例的方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#resolveArgument(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.method.support.ModelAndViewContainer,org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest,org.springframework.web.bind.support.WebDataBinderFactory)\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#resolveArgument(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.method.support.ModelAndViewContainer,org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest,org.springframework.web.bind.support.WebDataBinderFactory)\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolves argument values of type <a href=\"../../../../accept/SemanticApiVersionParser.Version.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.accept\"><code>SemanticApiVersionParser.Version</code></a>.",
      "translation": "解析类型为<a href=\"../../../../accept/SemanticApiVersionParser.Version.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.accept\"><code>SemanticApiVersionParser.Version</code></a>的参数值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolves a method parameter into an argument value from a given request.",
      "translation": "将方法参数解析为给定请求中的参数值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\">supportsParameter</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\">supportsParameter</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#resolveArgument(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.method.support.ModelAndViewContainer,org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest,org.springframework.web.bind.support.WebDataBinderFactory)\">resolveArgument</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code>",
      "translation": "`HandlerMethodArgumentResolver` 接口中的 <code><a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#resolveArgument(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.method.support.ModelAndViewContainer,org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest,org.springframework.web.bind.support.WebDataBinderFactory)\">resolveArgument</a></code>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>parameter</code> - the method parameter to resolve. This parameter must\nhave previously been passed to <a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.supportsParameter(MethodParameter)</code></a> which must\nhave returned <code>true</code>.",
      "translation": "<code>parameter</code> - 要解析的方法参数。此参数必须先前已传递给<a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.supportsParameter(MethodParameter)</code></a>，且该调用必须返回<code>true</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>binderFactory</code> - a factory for creating <a href=\"../../../../bind/WebDataBinder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.bind\"><code>WebDataBinder</code></a> instances",
      "translation": "<code>binderFactory</code> - 用于创建 <a href=\"../../../../bind/WebDataBinder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.bind\"><code>WebDataBinder</code></a> 实例的工厂",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>true</code> if this resolver supports the supplied parameter;\n<code>false</code> otherwise",
      "translation": "<code>true</code> 如果此解析器支持提供的参数；否则为 <code>false</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Exception</a></code> - in case of errors with the preparation of argument values",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Exception</a></code> - 在准备参数值时发生错误的情况下",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>parameter</code> - the method parameter to check",
      "translation": "<code>parameter</code> - 要检查的方法参数",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>mavContainer</code> - the ModelAndViewContainer for the current request",
      "translation": "<code>mavContainer</code> - 当前请求的 ModelAndViewContainer",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>webRequest</code> - the current request",
      "translation": "<code>webRequest</code> - 当前请求",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
